Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, make a move already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My rock ogre's gonna rock your block off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that wimpy card has a\Nchance against my giant rock guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I don't stand a chance unless maybe\NI use the Breath of Light card. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she do that? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Breath of Light\Nwears down, Rock Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It reduces them to rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That brings your life\Npoints down to zero, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, you lose and I rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.21,0:01:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You stink at this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan's right, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I do stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't win a duel\Nmonster to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.89,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I ever win?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me what I'm doing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's start by checking\Nyour deck, Joey. Huh? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:01:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go. Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerhouse lineup, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could win with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, your deck's filled with\Nnothing but monster cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I packed it with every\Nbutt-kicking monster I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not how the game works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters is all about\Ncombining your monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.89,0:02:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,cards with your magic cards\Nto increase their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,With no magic in your deck, your\Nmonsters will get creamed every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of stuff I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you gotta help me learn more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa's the real\Ngame expert in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa, I brought you a new student.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Student?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping since you know more\Nabout Duel Monsters than anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you'd teach me. Teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters is a very complex game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya beat me three games in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Teya beat you\Nfive times in a row, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Five? Oh, man. Huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I could teach you to be\Na great tournament duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But only if you're willing\Nto spend endless days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and sleepless nights filled\Nwith rigorous training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With an attitude like that, teaching\Nyou may not be worth my effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going there, smart mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi, help me convince him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will work hard, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Joey, teaching you duel\Nmonsters is too big a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not impossible. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, he already said he can't do it,\Nand if he can't do it, he can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I agree, you must work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll begin your\Ninstruction immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my young friend, and believe me,\Nunder my tutelage you will learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, can you name the most\Npowerful duel monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you name the weakest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know what a trap\Ncard is, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Duel fans and\Nour 10 million viewers at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and welcome to the Duel\NMonsters Duel Dome,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,where tonight the Duel Monsters\NRegional Championship will be decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the 200 duelists that have\Ncompeted in this marathon tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,only two competitors remain standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your cards together for\NWeevil Underwood, the Bug Brawler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And his opponent, the\Nnumber one ranked Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,raptor dino duelist\Nbug boy versus dinosaur
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,breath what kind of match is that that\Nshould have been me in there i know you've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,been training for weeks but those guys are\Nin another league you're just not ready
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,yet sure rub it in and\Non top of that you're
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so tired you can't keep your eyes open i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,think grandpa's lessons have been a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Too tough for him? So\Ntired, must rest. You
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,have no time for rest did you come here to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,learn dual monsters or\Ndid you come here to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.55,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,catch up on your sleeping\Nyou see it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,what they say you snooze you lose I must
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,have been nuts to think I could ever learn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This crazy game time for your\Nlesson. What? We're not done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not by a long shot, you slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now quit your whining, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've been working long and hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but you really are coming\Nalong as a dualist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm quite proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This package came for you. A package?\NWhat is it, Grandpa? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It just came in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Industrial Illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Industrial Illusions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the company that\Nmakes the Duel Monsters game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the heck would they be\Nsending a package to you, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible they heard\NI beat the world champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Kaiba? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't an official match or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but Kaiba did drop out of\Nthe tournament because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw your last pathetic card\Nso I can end this, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa's deck has no\Npathetic cards, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But it does contain\Nthe unstoppable Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hearing Kaiba's\Nname gives me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, guys, Raptor just stopped Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, these guys any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, they're both\Npretty tough customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil specializes in insect\Ncards and he's a great strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you've got Rex Raptor\Nand his dinosaur cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He uses their power to\Noverwhelm his opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Itsy-bitsy bugs against dinosaurs.\NRaptor has got this one in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself dinosaur child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:07:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as Raptor plays the\Nstrongest card in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The terrible two-headed King Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this match could\Nbe over right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back, monster fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the two-headed King Rex in play,\Nit looks like this duel is all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And all I have is this weak little buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil Underwood counters\Nwith a basic insect card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He plays a wimpy bug\Nagainst a giant dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The place will be covered in bug guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but I wouldn't\Nunderestimate Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rex, let's take this\Nchampionship. Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've attacked your way into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, how could your tiny dinosaur\Nbrain know when an enemy attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,my vortex activates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Which totally traps your King\NRex in its inescapable embrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My King Rex!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And while he's trapped there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll upgrade my basic insect by\Ngiving him armor with laser cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not such a weak little bug after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And King Rex is extinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat by a bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A stunning upset by Weevil\NUnderwood, our newest champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.07,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, King Rex squashed by an insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And now a very special\Nhonor for our new champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,here to present the Duel\NMonsters Championship Trophy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the creator of Duel Monsters and the\Npresident of Industrial Illusions,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen and\Nfellow duelists, I give you Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximillian Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And as regional champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I invite you to compete in a bold new\Ntournament I'm hosting at Duelist Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, with the announcement\Nthat you made tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have thousands of Duelists\Nflocking to Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and events such as this\Nwill hopefully attract
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,those who possess the\NMillennium Items I seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The package was delivered to the\Nboy just as you ordered, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,with all the excitement of the championships,\Nyou forgot to open your package, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:09:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of glove. And stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's an explanation on the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop it in and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Maximilian Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We just saw him on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous Maximilian Pegasus\Nsends greetings to my Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard some terribly\Ninteresting things about you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your impressive defeat of Seto\NKaiba intrigued me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to investigate your\Namazing dueling skills personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, right now, we\Nshall hold a special duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll play with a strict time limit\Nof 15 minutes, and when time's up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the player with the highest\Nlife points will be the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? Here, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he can't seriously expect you\Nto fight a duel against the videotape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:10:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's magic
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's growing dark and\Ncold and the others aren't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you taken us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no longer in the world, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will return you after\Nour game, but it's time to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.01,0:11:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the clock and\Nmake your move, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly. Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nervous, Yugi boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.39,0:11:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You have never faced a\Nduelist like me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will beat you to save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't save anyone with\Nthat dragon card. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you you've never\Nfaced anyone like me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know every move you'll make.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you can even make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing every move you'll make gives me\Na distinct advantage, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.91,0:12:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can anticipate your next play and\Ncounter it with this dragon capture jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It will draw the Komori dragon from\Nyour card and imprison the beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.35,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Trapped, never to be played against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,First he reads my mind, then he\Nbrings the monster on my card to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This dark dimension we're in\Nis known as the Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A mystical place where incredible\Nmonsters can be summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and the impossible is quite possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But what you're telling me can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Yugi, do you believe\Nthere is magic in these cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You invented this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In ancient times, the Egyptians\Ncalled this the Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:13:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful pharaohs would hold\Nmystical jewels in other dimensions,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,just as we're doing\Nnow, but not with cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They battled with real\Nmonsters and real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical forces so powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the Egyptians lost control of them\Nand nearly destroyed the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good story, Pegasus, but\Nthese monsters can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell that to my Dragon Piper,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,as his flute of resurrection\Nfrees your Kumori dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but puts him under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to counterattack Silver Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As you see, Yugi, these\Nmonsters are very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And also quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Yugi boy, you really\Nare quite entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you scowl and sneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.03,0:13:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So defiant and yet helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:14:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And so completely ignorant of the\Npower of your Millennium Puzzle. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 years ago, a powerful pharaoh\Nlocked the magic of the Shadow Games away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh captured these vast magical\Nenergies in seven mystical millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven items?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying that my\Npuzzle's one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and there are mystical\Nenergies locked within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic that could change your life forever\Nif you only knew how to unleash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.71,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply because I need you to know But\Nperhaps I have said too much And since the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,clock is still ticking I propose we resume\Nplaying Our little jewel He's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,time's running out and I still\Nhaven't figured out Whether
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he can really read my mind\NOr if it's some kind of trick
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to try something.\NMaybe my zombie warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute He definitely\Nknows what I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to have something to\Ndo with that weird eye of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.49,0:15:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That weird eye must somehow let\Nhim see the cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So no matter which card I pick,\Nhe's already one step ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But that gives me an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up now, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out for\Nyou and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is expecting me to play\None of the cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if I play a card\Neven I haven't seen yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if I draw a new card straight\Nfrom the deck without even looking at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know you plan to\Nplay the zombie warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm already prepared\Nto counter it with a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,card that makes even zombies\Nlie down and play dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out your little game, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be able to see\Nthe cards in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't see the cards\NI pull from the deck. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My next card is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the big scary Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mock me all you like, Pegasus, but\Nmy Magician will destroy that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead if you think it'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll do more than help, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll bring you closer to defeat and\Nbring me closer to saving my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If it can do all that,\Nby all means, play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely played.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But by using your Dark Magician, you've\Nlet me manipulate you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,By playing that one card,\Nyou have ensured my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a very rare card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the fearsome Faceless Mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that card before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But my Dark Magician is one of the\Nstrongest magic cards in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will he fare once\NI combine my Faceless
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mage with the equally\Nrare Eye of Illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack had no effect at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His faceless mage should\Nhave been destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's still standing and\NI'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm up by 300 life points, but only\Nbecause Pegasus is toying with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to find a way to beat\Nhim at his own shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus knows all kinds of\Ntricks. But I gotta find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to defeat him I just have to\Ntrust in my grandpa's cards
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I attack your combo with the\NCeltic Guardian This mighty
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,warrior will cut your faceless\Nmage down to size True,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,your guardian is mighty\NBut you have once again
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,underestimated the incredible\Npower of my Eye of Illusion No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The faceless mage doesn't\Nhave a dark magic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my own dark\Nmagician that attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is controlling him\Nwith the Eye of Illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he's using its magic to control\Nmy magician, what's protecting his mage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi, our time\Ntogether is nearly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And as I've more life points than\Nyou, it appears I am the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's not up just yet, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:19:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've left your faceless mage\Nvulnerable to a physical assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.93,0:19:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, we've run out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But how close was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had been able to complete\Nthat attack, I would have lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have taken the measure of your\Ntalents this day, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And when next we duel, we shall\Nplay for far higher stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You presume I'm giving you a\Nchoice in the matter, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.71,0:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For I, too, possess one of\Nthe seven Millennium Items,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the all-powerful Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A Millennium Eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.65,0:19:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll show you the\Ntrue extent of its magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I have found that,\Ngiven the proper incentive,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone can be made to play my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will do again, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.63,0:20:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How else will you ever reclaim\Nyour grandfather's soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa!
